% ok Claude (druhé čítanie) 2026-11-20: p4 s3 b4: LH beat 2 drawn without flags; read as eighths (A3/F#3 over D3/B2) so the bar adds up — The LH heads on beat 2 sit at the two eighth positions under the soprano's beamed eighths, and only eighths make the bar add up; the pitches A3/F#3 over D3/B2 read cleanly on the lines.
% ok Claude (druhé čítanie) 2026-11-20: p4 s3 b4: bass beat 3 note on a ledger read as E2 (detector put it near D2) — The note sits on a ledger line drawn one space below the bottom line, which is E2, and the final cadence E7 to A (bass E2 to A2) confirms it.
